WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Developers” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Open the documentation
From the Developers tab open the full API documentation or the OpenAPI specification. The production base URL is https://linklysa.io/api/v1.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Prepare the request
We use GET /api/v1/customers?limit=5 with Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY. We keep the key on the server and never show it to users.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Run the request and read the result
We run the request against the local server with a training account. The HTTP code and the real response appear; ok: true means the request succeeded, and data holds the customers and the paging data.
